Steps:
Navigate to {{app_login_url}} and log in with email address and password
Navigate to {{app_dashboard_url}}
Click {{dashboard_create_project_button}}
Enter the project name 'E2E Test Project' in {{dialog_project_name_input}}
Click {{dialog_create_submit_button}}

Navigate to {{app_project_url}} (using the projectId obtained in case-1)
Click {{spec_create_button}}
Enter 'E2E Test Spec' in {{spec_name_input}}
Click {{dialog_create_submit_button}}

Navigate to {{app_spec_url}}
Click {{testcase_add_row_button}}
Click the last added row to enter edit mode
Type 'Sample Test Case' and press the Escape key

Navigate to {{app_spec_url}}
Click {{spec_start_test_button}}
Enter 'E2E Test Run' in {{report_name_input}}
Click {{report_start_confirm_button}}

Navigate to {{app_spec_url}}
Click the first row of {{testcase_row_checkbox}} to select it
Click {{testcase_delete_button}}
Click {{testcase_delete_confirm_button}}
